        body=body.replace('<h2>Supplying berseem seeds?</h2><p>Share your quantity, destination or origin, specification and preferred shipment timing.</p>','<h2>Buying berseem seed?</h2><p>Tell us your quantity and your town or state. Dealers and farmers are welcome.</p>',1)
        body=body.replace('<a class="button" href="/contact/?product=berseem-seeds&intent=supply">Enquire about berseem seeds ↗</a>',f'<a class="button" href="{wa}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy on WhatsApp ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/contact/?product=berseem-seeds&intent=buy">Send a buying enquiry ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/?product=berseem-seeds&intent=supply">Overseas supplier? Send your offer →</a>',1)
        buyer=f'''<section class="product-information wrap" aria-label="Buy berseem seed in India"><div class="specification-heading"><span class="eyebrow">FOR DEALERS & FARMERS IN INDIA</span><h2>Buy imported berseem seed</h2><p>We sell imported berseem seed in India for the rabi fodder season. Variety, origin, germination and packing are confirmed for each lot before you buy.</p></div><div class="specification-table-wrap"><table class="specification-table"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Seed</th><td>Imported berseem (Egyptian clover, <i>Trifolium alexandrinum</i>) fodder seed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Who we supply</th><td>Seed dealers, distributors, dairy farms and farmers across India</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seed per acre</th><td>About 8–10 kg/acre (20–25 kg/hectare) is a common reference. See the sowing guide below.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sowing time</th><td>Late September to early October is a common reference for north India. Follow local advice for your area.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">How to order</th><td>Send quantity and location on WhatsApp. Price and lot details are confirmed with each quotation.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a class="button" href="{wa}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask for price on WhatsApp ↗</a></p></section>'''
