        india=f'''<section class="product-information wrap" aria-label="Buy alfalfa seed in India"><div class="specification-heading"><span class="eyebrow">FOR DEALERS & FARMERS IN INDIA</span><h2>Buy alfalfa (lucerne) seed in India</h2><p>Besides exporting, Shiva Exim sells alfalfa (lucerne / rijka) fodder seed to seed dealers, distributors, dairy farms and farmers across India. Variety, germination and packing are confirmed for each lot before you buy.</p></div><div class="specification-table-wrap"><table class="specification-table"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Seed</th><td>Alfalfa / lucerne (<i>Medicago sativa</i>) fodder planting seed, single-year and multi-year</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Who we supply</th><td>Seed dealers, distributors, dairy farms and farmers across India</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seed per acre</th><td>About 8 kg/acre (20 kg/hectare) is a common reference. See the sowing guide below.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cutting</th><td>First cut about 60–65 days after sowing, then every 20–25 days (TNAU reference).</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">How to order</th><td>Send quantity and location on WhatsApp. Price and lot details are confirmed with each quotation.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a class="button" href="{wa}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask for price on WhatsApp ↗</a></p></section>'''
